 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Requests select a site with `X-Larder-Site` (default `main`). An unknown
+site returns 400 with code `unknown_site`. Batches (including waste), stock
+on hand, cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes are restricted to that
+site. Receiving orders accepts only locations in that site. Items, suppliers,
+recipes and dishes are shared. Other reports and temperature checks retain
+their existing scope.
