 - Fridges must read at or below 5 °C and freezers at or below -15 °C. Each
   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- `sites` contains site records with string `id` and `name`. Every location
+  has a `site` referring to its site id; batches and stock-takes inherit their
+  site from their location. Schema 1 and 2 files migrate to schema 3 with all
+  existing locations in `main` (Main kitchen), without changing stock.
+- Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared across sites.
